{
  "_about": "DATAWATCH v1 (laneDATA1), read by Scripts/DataWatcher.cs. enabled false = the component never starts (shipped default); the launch arg -datawatch turns it on without editing this file. pollSeconds = file-time poll, settleSeconds = a changed file must keep the same write time for this long before it is reloaded (half-written files). rows: file -> the existing static Reload* the owner system already has (type is the class name, method is parameterless static, only names starting with Reload are ever called). skip: files that must NOT be reloaded live and why (documentation, never read by code). Both data copies (Assets/Data and StreamingAssets) are watched, newest write time wins.",
